        "id": "24949970"
       }
      ],
      "value": "Disease susceptibility may be associated with variants affecting the gene represented in this entry. Three common non-coding variants of CLEC16A in strong linkage disequilibrium reach genome-wide significance for association with the disease (PubMed:17632545). The non-coding variant rs12708716 is associated with reduced expression of CLEC16A in beta cells and reduced beta cell function (PubMed:24949970)"
     }
    ]
